{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手鄭俊弘（Fred）日前偕移居加拿大的囝囝鄭讚廷（Asher）為太太何雁詩（Stephanie）慶祝34歲生日，一家三口團圓，以行動粉碎夫妻婚變之說。</p><p>原來兩夫妻的生日僅相差8天，11月10日43歲牛一的他在社交網上載生日派對實況，雖然陪他</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T08:23:54.049988+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T08:01:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T08:17:12.986937+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T08:17:12.986937+00:00","content_hash":"fa1c414557e072e89821c9d7c16a93eb0f55f8b3a137943c0d0daf68f6a9257b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}